Provenance and modifications:

This skill is derived from
https://github.com/strands-agents/agent-sop/tree/main/skills/agent-sop-author
from the Apache-2.0 licensed project Strands Agents Agent SOP. It was
downloaded verbatim and then modified by demiourgoi: the `SKILL.md`
frontmatter was changed to conform to the Agent Skills specification,
and the skill was reworked so it now generates agent skills (a skill
directory with a `SKILL.md` in the Agent Skills format, with
deterministic logic in `scripts/`) instead of `.sop.md` SOP files;
`validate-sop.sh` was renamed to `validate-skill.sh` and extended with
the authoritative `uvx --from skills-ref agentskills validate`
specification check. As a derivative of an Apache-2.0 work it remains
licensed under Apache-2.0. Full license text:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 and LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
in this repository.

The bundled asset `assets/agent-skills-specification.md` is third-party
documentation licensed under CC-BY-4.0; see `assets/LICENSE` for its
attribution.
